title: Pu_Entry2
---
    <<if $PuSceneMeting and $ShopkeeperMet>>
        <<jump Scene4>>
    <<elseif $PuSceneMeting>>
        …
        PLAYER: (I should go talk to the shopkeeper first)
    <<else>>
        <<jump PuScene3>>
<<endif>>
===

title: PuScene3
---
//สอนตกปลา
<<camera_shoulder_in "Dialogue System" "Pu">>
GRANDPA: Give it a try. See if you still know how
<<camera_reset "Dialogue System">>
<<turn_object_to_face "player(V3)" "LookSea">>
<<allow_fishing>>
<<force_next_catch "CommonFish" 1>>
<<wait_for_catch "CommonFish">>
<<block_fishing>>
//ตกได้ขยะ
<<turn_object_to_face "player(V3)" "Pu">>
<<camera_shoulder_in "Dialogue System" "Pu">>
GRANDPA: That rod's seen better days — no wonder you're pulling up junk.
GRANDPA: Don't throw it out, though. Go have a word with the shop over there. They'll take it off your hands.
<<camera_reset "Dialogue System">>
<<set $PuSceneMeting = true>>
===

title: SHOPKEEPER
---
<<if not $PuSceneMeting>>
    …
    PLAYER: (I will talk GRANDPA)
<<else>>
<<camera_shoulder_in "Dialogue System" "SHOPKEEPER">>
SHOPKEEPER: Well now… you're old man's grandkid, aren't you?
SHOPKEEPER: Oh, I remember. You were about this tall last I saw you.
SHOPKEEPER: Just got back?
PLAYER: Yeah. I've been missing this place, I guess.
SHOPKEEPER: Mm… that's nice.
SHOPKEEPER: My boy moved to the city, you know. Hasn't been back in a long while.
SHOPKEEPER: Anyway — let's see what you've got there.
//AfterSell
SHOPKEEPER: There's a rod out back. Been collecting dust three years now. Nobody's ever wanted it.
SHOPKEEPER: Take it. I'll knock the price down for you.
<<camera_reset "Dialogue System">>
<<set $ShopkeeperMet = true>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Scene4
---
<<camera_shoulder_in "Dialogue System" "Pu">>
GRANDPA: Got yourself a new rod, then. Here — take this. It's bait.
GRANDPA: Go on, try again.
<<camera_reset "Dialogue System">>
GRANDPA: I got one! I got one!
GRANDPA: Still got the hands for it, I see.
GRANDPA: Let's see how many you can pull in.
<<turn_object_to_face "player(V3)" "LookSea">>
<<allow_fishing>>
<<wait_for_catch_count 2>>
<<block_fishing>>
<<set $CaughtFiveFish = true>>
<<turn_object_to_face "player(V3)" "Pu">>
GRANDPA: That ought to be plenty. The shop down the way buys fish — go see what they'll give you.
===

title: Scene5
---
<<if not $PuSceneMeting>>
    …
    PLAYER: (I will talk GRANDPA)
<<elseif not $ShopkeeperMet>>
    …
    PLAYER: (I will talk SHOPKEEPER)
<<elseif not $CaughtFiveFish>>
    …
    PLAYER: (I will talk GRANDPA)
<<else>>
FISHMONGER: Oh, hello there… you'd be the old man's grandkid, wouldn't you? He's talked about you.
PLAYER: That's me. Just came back to visit.
FISHMONGER: That's nice. It's not every day a new face walks past my window.
FISHMONGER: Hold on — is that a rod? You fish?
PLAYER: My grandpa taught me. I can hold my own, a little.
FISHMONGER: Ha! A little's still better than nobody fishing at all.
FISHMONGER: I buy, you know. Whatever you pull up, bring it by and let me have a look.
<<LoadScene "Scene3">>
<<endif>>
===